              "type": "text",
              "id": "MEEzV",
              "name": "Subtitle",
              "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1200,
              "content": "“Ink & Amber”, dark-first (the app is locked to dark). Synced with the shipped SwiftUI app on 27 Sep 2026 (main @ 97605ce), including the cycle plan, the Funded state, the plan-origin tags and the discard alert. Tokens mirror DesignSystem/Theme.swift, Typography.swift and Spacing.swift (color/negative, color/plan = Theme.negative, Theme.plan); each component is named after the SwiftUI view it represents. Switch the “mode” theme on any frame to preview light.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font/family",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
