                  "id": "p1g0B",
                  "name": "Desc",
                  "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1200,
                  "content": "Picks up from E5: the owner paged forward past the present cycle (CyclePaging.canGoForward opens up) and October is already populated by carry-over. Nothing here is typed from scratch — the work is adjusting amounts, waking the rows that matter again, and adding what is new. The ＋ toolbar button is untouched: it still logs an expense, never a plan item (PRD goal 2). Plan items are added from a row at the foot of the list, the same PickerAddRow pattern as “New Category”.",
