                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 402,
                      "content": "The Auto bolt becomes tappable on an item with an Account, opening a one-item Menu: \"Covered in BNI\" (◯→ringed bolt) or \"Not covered yet\". There is still no manual Done — the Expense posts itself on the due day and the check becomes Auto posted, whatever the funded state. The Envelope tray works the same way: \"Moved to Jago\" / \"Not moved yet\".",
